<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/1/eng@/~cl_3__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4a) A member of the Lembaga may, at any time, resign from his office by giving a written notice to the Lembaga and the Lembaga shall obtain the consent of the Yang di-Pertuan Agong or the respective Rulers, as the case may be.”. New section 3a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/1/eng@> .
